Hanuman approves Sita refusal and asks for recognition token --- Sita begins crow token on Chitrakuta lap --- Rama looses Brahma reed that chases Indra son crow through worlds --- Rama spares suppliant crow but smites right eye --- Sita asks why Rama tolerates thief and urges pity and shafts --- Sita sends greetings to Kausalya and praises following Lakshmana --- Sita vows life for one month and gives divine crest jewel --- Hanuman takes jewel bows and turns glad toward return
